    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olkitok tenebo isiruai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Ore kishomi o lodung'oro liatua oipirare oloo saen naa keikeni te nena olong'i ile naasishoi; kake ore teina olong e sabato naa keboli o enkolong nadoli olapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kejing olkitok eimu olgoriet leina kishomi eing'uaa auluo, neitashe ninye te mbata entaloishi e kishomi. Neitayu ilapolosak ilasarri lenye oopejori, ilasarri lenyena le seriani, neseremisho tempolos e kishomi, neipung alo auluo, kake meikeni kishomi o metaa teipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore iltung'ana leina kop neseremisho te nejing'ieki ina kishomi te dukuya Olaitoriani too sabatoni te nedoli olapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo asar opejori oitayio ilo kitok aitaiki Olaitoriani te ina olong e sabato naa keaku ilkuoo le kerra ile lemeeta entioto, o lmeregesh lemeeta entioto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o lasar le ntapa te nebo olmeregesh neaku e efa, te nebo olasar le ntapa tenebo ilkuoo keaku ake duoo anaa enaidim, tenebo eilata te pooki efa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore teina olong nadoli olapa naa keitayu ninye oloti oing'oni lemeeta entioto, olkuoo le kerra o lmeregesh, lemeeta entioto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anaa olasar le ntapa neitayu e efa tenebo oloing'oni tenebo e efa tenebo olmeregesh, tenebo olkuoo le kerra anaa enaidim aitayu, tenebo hini e ilata te pooki efa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie ejing olkitok, nejing'u atua eimu ilo goriet le kishomi, naa ina oitoi ake naimua eitoki aim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore peyie epuonu iltung'ana leina kop dukuya o Laitoriani te lelo siruai oogeluno, ore ilo ojing'u te kishomi e moikuape aseremisho neipang alo te kishomi e kopikop; ore ilo ojing'u te kishomi e kopikop neipang auluo te kishomi e moikuape; meetae oltung'ani oshuko aipang eimaa kishomi natijing'ie, kake keipang ake pooki ng'ae aitoriori alo dukuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie ejing ninche atua naa kejing olkitok atua tenebo ninche; naa teneipang ninche boo neipang sii ninye boo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore te lelo siruai o nena rishat naageluno, ore olasar le ntapa tenebo oloti oing'oni naa keaku efa nabo, ore tenebo olkuoo le ker naa efa, ore tenebo ilkuoo le kerra anaa ake duoo enaidim oltung'ani aishoru, tenebo hini e ilata te efa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teneitayu olkitok enkishooroto to lpela aa olasar opejori arashu olasar le seriani anaa enkishooroto o lpela to Laitoriani, ore ina kishomi naipirare oloo saen naa kebolokini ninye; naa keitayu ninye olasar lenye opejori arashu olasar lenye le seriani anaa enaas ninye te nkolong e sabato. Naa keipang ninye auluo, ore peyie eipang ninye auluo, neikeni kishomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olasar le anaake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naa keitayu ninye olkuoo le ker lo lari obo lemeeta entioto metaa olasar opejori to Laitoriani anaake; tadekenya eitayu ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitayu tenebo ninye olasar le ntapa tenebo ninye anaake tadekenya, ematua nabo e ile e efa, o ematua nabo e uni e hini e eilata peyie eitashal ina tapa, anaa olasar le ntapa lo Laitoriani; ena ninye enkitanapata naipirta ilo asar opejori le anaake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku neijia eikununi ilo kuoo le ker tenebo olasar le ndaa tenebo eilata eitaini, anaake tadekenya metaa olasar ouno anaake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olkitok o enkop",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai: Tenelo neitayu olkitok enkishooroto aitaiki obo loo layiok lenyena tiatua enjung'ore enye, naa keaku enoo layiok lenyena, entoki nara enenye te njung'ore. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 25.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake tenelo neitayu enkishooroto aitaiki obo loo sinkan lenyena neaku enenye o metabaiki ilo ari le lakunoto; nerrinyokino aaku enolkitok; keaku ilayiok lenyena ake ooidim aatushum enkishooroto te njung'ore enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meya olkitok enjung'ore hoo nabo oo ltung'ana nemerrumoo ninche te wueji enye; keisho ninye ilayiok lenyena enjung'ore enye teine wueji enye makewan, metaa meetae hoo obo loo ltung'ana laainei ooruni entoki enye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iwuejitin neeyierishoreki te nkaji e Nkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie aaitijing'u nanu te wueji najing'ieki, ina apa naatii embata eina kishomi, te nkalo e moikuape oo lgilat sinyat tenkaraki ilapolosak; ore teine nadol ewueji te bayie o loontoluo te nkiting'oto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki ninye nanu, “Nena ewueji nepejie ilapolosak enkishooroto o lasar le nkitarruorroto tenebo enkishooroto o lasar le ngoki naa teine sii epej olasar le ntapa peyie metum ninche aayau ninche aaitupuku ine wueji olgoriet le boo, neitabaiki esinyatisho olorere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naariku nanu dukuya atua ilo goriet lioriong naarik nanu ilpijat pokira oong'uan lo lgoriet; ore te pooki pijata lo lgoriet netii olgoriet ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore tiatua nena matuan pokira ong'uan o lgoriet netii gorieti dung'orot, intemat enkaina artam te nkadoro o ntemat enkaina tomoni uni endapasho; ore nena pokira ong'uan nerisioro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
